codex
The checks flag a traffic-mix shift: it accounts arithmetically for almost all of the observed decline. Holding platform and country mix fixed leaves a change near zero, but that is not an estimate of v2’s causal effect. The completeness and count-integrity checks passed; the data lacks a load watermark and user-level records to verify completeness or account for repeated searches in the intervals.
